{"id":"d576fa154ddad647","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-pred-category.md","title":"Predicate category","display":"df-pred-category — Predicate category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-pred-category","aliases":["16-df-pred-category","Predicate category"],"display":"df-pred-category — Predicate category","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Section 0.2, pp. 11–12 (PDF 31–32); explicit tagged-arrow encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-pred-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-pred-category</span><span>Predicate category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pred-category — Predicate category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 0.2, pp. 11–12 (PDF 31–32); explicit tagged-arrow encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的带源靶标签箭头编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,X)\">\\(A=(I,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(J,Y)\">\\(B=(J,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(K,Z)\">\\(C=(K,Z)\\)</span> 是下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_P\">\\(O_P\\)</span> 的对象。箭头是带标签记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\)</span>；仅在源靶已固定的 Hom 语境中简写为函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:I\\to J\">\\(f:I\\to J\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[X]\">\\(f[X]\\)</span> 为函数图的直接像。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 在下文构造。纤维对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,X)\">\\((I,X)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> 的识别只通过显式双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_I\">\\(b_I\\)</span> 使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_P\">\\(M_P\\)</span> 内的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 为函数图；该记录内部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_I=\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle\\mid i\\in I\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_I=\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle\\mid i\\in I\\}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\circ f\">\\(g\\circ f\\)</span> 均取函数图的恒等与复合。投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_1\">\\(p_1\\)</span> 的值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,J,f)\">\\((I,J,f)\\)</span> 才是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 的带标签箭头。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nM_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\mid A=(I,X)\\in O_P\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_P\\land f\\in J^I\\land f[X]\\subseteq Y\\},\\\\\ns_P\\langle A,B,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t_P\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_P(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_P(\\langle B,C,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_P,M_P,s_P,t_P,e_P,c_P\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\qquad p_1\\langle(I,X),(J,Y),f\\rangle\\coloneqq(I,J,f),\\\\\np&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nM_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\mid A=(I,X)\\in O_P\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_P\\land f\\in J^I\\land f[X]\\subseteq Y\\},\\\\\ns_P\\langle A,B,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t_P\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_P(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_P(\\langle B,C,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_P,M_P,s_P,t_P,e_P,c_P\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\qquad p_1\\langle(I,X),(J,Y),f\\rangle\\coloneqq(I,J,f),\\\\\np&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)&amp;=\\{(I,X)\\mid X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nb_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(I,X),X\\rangle\\mid X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nb_I&amp;:\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal P(I),\\\\\n(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I((I,X),(I,Y))\\ne\\varnothing&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)&amp;=\\{(I,X)\\mid X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nb_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(I,X),X\\rangle\\mid X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nb_I&amp;:\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal P(I),\\\\\n(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I((I,X),(I,Y))\\ne\\varnothing&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§0.2，pp.11–12（PDF31–32）。对象与态射条件对应原书的 Pred；源靶标签将其 Hom 族实现为本目录统一的六元组范畴。相同的裸函数可位于不同谓词对象间，故不能把裸图直接当作全局箭头。投影的箭头值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,J,f)\">\\((I,J,f)\\)</span> 与 Set 的真实箭头编码匹配。</p>\n<p>恒等保持谓词，直接像的复合保持包含；范畴公理由函数律继承。垂直箭头的底层函数必须为恒等函数，因此存在当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq Y\">\\(X\\subseteq Y\\)</span>，且至多一条。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_I\">\\(b_I\\)</span> 是对象集与幂集的双射，不将两者断言为字面相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带源靶标签箭头编码；$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带源靶标签箭头编码；$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带源靶标签箭头编码；$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"B=(J,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"C=(K,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"O_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"f[X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"b_I","display":false},{"tex":"M_P","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_I=\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle\\mid i\\in I\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\circ f","display":false},{"tex":"p_1","display":false},{"tex":"(I,J,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_P&\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nM_P&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\mid A=(I,X)\\in O_P\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_P\\land f\\in J^I\\land f[X]\\subseteq Y\\},\\\\\ns_P\\langle A,B,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t_P\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_P(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_P(\\langle B,C,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}&\\coloneqq\\langle O_P,M_P,s_P,t_P,e_P,c_P\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,X)&\\coloneqq I,\\qquad p_1\\langle(I,X),(J,Y),f\\rangle\\coloneqq(I,J,f),\\\\\np&\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})&,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)&=\\{(I,X)\\mid X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nb_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(I,X),X\\rangle\\mid X\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nb_I&:\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal P(I),\\\\\n(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I((I,X),(I,Y))\\ne\\varnothing&\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(I,J,f)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"b_I","display":false}],"bytes":3057,"backlinks":[{"id":"9150feb72afa963d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-pred-category]]；$\\mathbf{Pred}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathcal U}$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"26dec4f877ca3671","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-pred-category]] 的 $\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}$ 与规范投影 $p:\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；$q$ 为同源同靶候选函子。$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pred-category|df-pred-category — Predicate category]]"}],"outgoing":["25a281534aa42440","fc49efccd7348d66","09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}